"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunk_8x8_developer_docs=globalThis.webpackChunk_8x8_developer_docs||[]).push([[58505],{8082:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"id":"2026-07-23-agentaveragetimetoanswer-metric","date":"2026-07-23","products":["Analytics"],"product":"Analytics","channel":"","changeType":"Added","title":"agentAverageTimeToAnswer metric","excerpt":"The agentAverageTimeToAnswer metric is now documented on the Work Analytics agent-activity endpoints. It is a timing metric, reported in seconds, and sits alongside the other agent timing metrics such as agentTotalTalkTime, averageTalkingInteractionsTime, averageOnHoldInteractionsTime, and averageWrapUpTime.","hasArticle":true,"bodyHtml":"<p>The <code>agentAverageTimeToAnswer</code> metric is now documented on the Work Analytics agent-activity endpoints. It is a timing metric, reported in seconds, and sits alongside the other agent timing metrics such as <code>agentTotalTalkTime</code>, <code>averageTalkingInteractionsTime</code>, <code>averageOnHoldInteractionsTime</code>, and <code>averageWrapUpTime</code>.</p>\\n<h2>Where it&#39;s available</h2>\\n<p>Request <code>agentAverageTimeToAnswer</code> through the <code>metrics</code> query parameter on either agent-activity endpoint:</p>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>Endpoint</th>\\n<th>Guide</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<td><code>GET /v2/pbxes/{pbxId}/agent-activity</code></td>\\n<td><a href=\\"/analytics/docs/work-analytics-agent-activity\\">Agent Activity</a></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>GET /v2/pbxes/{pbxId}/queue-agent-activity</code></td>\\n<td><a href=\\"/analytics/docs/work-analytics-queue-agent-activity\\">Queue Agent Activity</a></td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table>\\n<p>On the per-queue endpoint the metric is attributed to each queue, so you can compare an agent&#39;s timing across the queues they work. Timing values are in seconds and may be returned as decimals.</p>\\n<p>Full descriptions of every metric are on the reference pages:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\"/analytics/reference/get-agent-activity\\">Agent Activity reference</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\"/analytics/reference/get-agent-queue-activity\\">Agent Activity per Queue reference</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n"}')}}]);